Description "General Grievous

^9Weapons:
- Melee
- Jedi Lightsabers ^9(Dual)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (1)
-- Mastery (2)
^2-- Chain: 6
^2-- Spec Damage: 2x
^1-- BP Regen: 2/.4s

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]

^5Powers:
- Cyber Jump (1)

^8Attributes:
- Beskar (3)
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (3)
- Force Block (2)
- Strength (1)
- Armor Regen (1)
- Cortosis (1)
- Blast Armor
- Brawler Guard
- Tracking Beacon
- BP-Free Jumps
^2- Knockback Taken: .3x
^1- Skill Recharge: .9x

The fiendish leader of the Separatist Droid Army. Excels at close-range encounters as well as quick escapes."